# Production Environment Configuration

This file contains recommended settings for production deployments.

```env
# ============================================================================
# PRODUCTION SETTINGS
# ============================================================================

# SERVER
SERVER_PORT=8000
SERVER_HOST=0.0.0.0
ENVIRONMENT=production

# ============================================================================
# SECURITY - IMPORTANT: CHANGE THESE VALUES IN PRODUCTION
# ============================================================================

# Generate a secure JWT secret:
# python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(32))"
JWT_SECRET=your-secure-production-secret-key-here-change-this
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256

# ============================================================================
# SERVICE DISCOVERY
# ============================================================================
EUREKA_ENABLED=true
EUREKA_SERVER_URL=http://discovery-service:8761/eureka/
EUREKA_APP_NAME=gateway-service

# ============================================================================
# UPSTREAM SERVICES - Use DNS names or load balancers in production
# ============================================================================
USER_SERVICE_URL=http://user-service:8001
CONTRACT_SERVICE_URL=http://contract-service:8002
ENTITY_SERVICE_URL=http://entity-service:8003
TIMESHEET_SERVICE_URL=http://timesheet-service:8004

# ============================================================================
# LOGGING
# ============================================================================
LOG_LEVEL=INFO

# ============================================================================
# CORS - Restrict origins in production
# ============================================================================
CORS_ORIGINS=https://smmc-io-prod.timesmart.io
CORS_CREDENTIALS=true
CORS_METHODS=GET,POST,PUT,DELETE,OPTIONS,PATCH,HEAD
CORS_HEADERS=Authorization,Content-Type,X-Correlation-ID

# ============================================================================
# MONITORING
# ============================================================================
ACTUATOR_ENABLED=true

# ============================================================================
# TIMEOUTS
# ============================================================================
REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=30

# ============================================================================
# DISTRIBUTED TRACING
# ============================================================================
ZIPKIN_ENABLED=true
ZIPKIN_URL=http://zipkin:9411/api/v2/spans
```

## Deployment Recommendations

### 1. Security

- [ ] Change `JWT_SECRET` to a secure value
- [ ] Restrict `CORS_ORIGINS` to your domains only
- [ ] Use HTTPS in production (reverse proxy/load balancer)
- [ ] Keep dependencies updated: `pip install --upgrade pip -r requirements.txt`
- [ ] Use secrets management (Kubernetes Secrets, AWS Secrets Manager, etc.)

### 2. Performance

- [ ] Run multiple Uvicorn workers behind a load balancer
- [ ] Use a reverse proxy (nginx, Traefik, etc.) for:
  - TLS termination
  - Request compression
  - Rate limiting
  - DDoS protection
- [ ] Enable request timeout caching
- [ ] Monitor upstream service performance

### 3. Monitoring & Logging

- [ ] Enable distributed tracing (Zipkin/Jaeger)
- [ ] Setup centralized logging (ELK, Splunk, CloudWatch)
- [ ] Configure alerts on health check failures
- [ ] Monitor response times and error rates
- [ ] Setup dashboard for gateway metrics

### 4. Deployment

- [ ] Use Docker with appropriate resource limits
- [ ] Deploy with Kubernetes for high availability
- [ ] Setup health check probes
- [ ] Configure graceful shutdown timeout
- [ ] Use environment-specific configurations
- [ ] Implement blue-green deployment strategy

### 5. Network

- [ ] Use service mesh (Istio, Linkerd) for advanced routing
- [ ] Configure network policies
- [ ] Implement rate limiting
- [ ] Setup circuit breaker for failing services
- [ ] Use retry policies with exponential backoff

### 6. Example Docker Compose Production

```yaml
version: '3.8'

services:
  api-gateway:
    image: api-gateway-service:1.0.0  # Use specific version tag
    container_name: api-gateway-prod
    ports:
      - "8000:8000"
    environment:
      - ENVIRONMENT=production
      - SERVER_PORT=8000
      - JWT_SECRET=${JWT_SECRET}  # From secrets
      - LOG_LEVEL=INFO
      - REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=30
    restart: always
    healthcheck:
      test: ["CMD", "curl", "-f", "http://localhost:8000/actuator/health"]
      interval: 30s
      timeout: 10s
      retries: 3
      start_period: 10s
    resources:
      limits:
        cpus: '1'
        memory: 512M
      reservations:
        cpus: '0.5'
        memory: 256M
    networks:
      - microservices
    logging:
      driver: "json-file"
      options:
        max-size: "10m"
        max-file: "3"

  # Add other services...

networks:
  microservices:
    driver: bridge
```

### 7. Kubernetes Deployment Example

```yaml
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: api-gateway
  labels:
    app: api-gateway
spec:
  replicas: 3
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: api-gateway
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: api-gateway
    spec:
      containers:
      - name: api-gateway
        image: api-gateway-service:1.0.0
        ports:
        - containerPort: 8000
        env:
        - name: ENVIRONMENT
          value: "production"
        - name: JWT_SECRET
          valueFrom:
            secretKeyRef:
              name: gateway-secrets
              key: jwt-secret
        - name: LOG_LEVEL
          value: "INFO"
        resources:
          requests:
            memory: "256Mi"
            cpu: "250m"
          limits:
            memory: "512Mi"
            cpu: "1000m"
        livenessProbe:
          httpGet:
            path: /actuator/health
            port: 8000
          initialDelaySeconds: 10
          periodSeconds: 30
        readinessProbe:
          httpGet:
            path: /actuator/health
            port: 8000
          initialDelaySeconds: 5
          periodSeconds: 10
---
apiVersion: v1
kind: Service
metadata:
  name: api-gateway-service
spec:
  selector:
    app: api-gateway
  ports:
  - protocol: TCP
    port: 80
    targetPort: 8000
  type: LoadBalancer
```

## Environment Variables for Different Stages

### Development
```env
ENVIRONMENT=development
LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG
CORS_ORIGINS=*
EUREKA_ENABLED=false
```

### Testing/QA
```env
ENVIRONMENT=qa
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
CORS_ORIGINS=https://qa.yourdomain.com
EUREKA_ENABLED=true
```

### User Acceptance Testing
```env
ENVIRONMENT=uat
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
CORS_ORIGINS=https://uat.yourdomain.com
EUREKA_ENABLED=true
ZIPKIN_ENABLED=true
```

### Production
```env
ENVIRONMENT=production
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
CORS_ORIGINS=https://yourdomain.com
EUREKA_ENABLED=true
ZIPKIN_ENABLED=true
REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=30
```

